scenario.en:
A component mounts and runs:<br/><pre>const [count, setCount] = useState(0);
useEffect(() => {
  const id = setInterval(() => setCount(count + 1), 1000);
  return () => clearInterval(id);
}, []);</pre>After 5 seconds, what does <code>count</code> display, and why? Then say what one-line change makes it count 1, 2, 3, … correctly.

