An effect subscribes to a chat room and fetches its history:<br/><pre>useEffect(() => {
  const sock = connect(roomId);
  sock.on('msg', addMessage);
  fetch(`/api/history/${roomId}`).then(r => r.json()).then(setHistory);
}, [roomId]);</pre>Users report duplicate messages and history flashing the wrong room when switching fast. Diagnose the structural causes via the setup/cleanup-pair lens, then self-check.

